{
  "answer": "OAuth2 scopes work with FastAPI Security dependencies by using the `SecurityScopes` class from `fastapi.security`. This class is used to declare the security scopes for OAuth2 schemes. When declaring OAuth2 scopes, you can use the `Security()` function instead of `Depends()`. If the dependency function doesn't have any scope requirements, you can use `Depends` with the OAuth2 scheme, without the need to use `Security`. This allows for a more fine-grained permission system, following the OAuth2 standard, integrated into your OpenAPI application and API docs. [reference/security/index-6]",
